        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Yang Perlu Diperhatikan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Draft rule — bisa langsung dihapus\n• Active rule — harus di-deactivate dulu\n• Batch delete — pilih beberapa rule, hapus sekaligus\n• Kalau ragu, **Deactivate** dulu daripada hapus permanen",
